  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de este programa es fomentar la acumulacin de capital humano en familias que viven en situacin de pobreza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to promote human capital accumulation in the most vulnerable population.</narrative>
  </description>
